    "numeric_role_inventory": [
      "1106 ensure_food_material_object enforces inventory row quantity1 and item/location match for existing object, creates one stable object otherwise. Native food-lot material quantity is a distinct source-unit count, not row stack quantity; per-unit cataloguefloat times u32count is finite under actual catalogue bounds, but caller positivequantity and row/lot single-owner relationship still require native writer proof.",
      "1106 FoodLot remove/split uses checked material_revision+1 and shared bounded retained_component, source/child ingredient residual subtraction to preserve source-unit provenance. split_lot explicitly validates0<taken<=original; move_or_split andremove_party wrapper rely actual callers for that domain. Generic invalid directarguments are not native admitted witnesses. Full transfer changes exact personal/party row link without amount arithmetic; object rehome belongs actual caller.",
      "1106 lot_for_inventory has exactly one failure: absent personal food metadata. Earlier246 personal .ok scan therefore skips nonfood/absent-lot candidates, not arbitrary hidden parser/computation failures. Retain legitimate absence policy; missing expectedfood-lot integrity still requires actual row producer.",
      "1106 consume_food_contamination_provenance deletes on full ratio before native246 full shared lot deletion, so rejected provenance-orphan suspicion: bypassing delete_party_food_lot alone does not prove dangling provenance. Native medicine consume called before branch too, and actual herbalism body remains needed before medicine-orphan claim. Full helper deletepersonal/party cleans medicine/provenance/contamination/lot.",
      "1106 contamination provenance digest length-frames source IDs and floatbits; producer cooking247 creates aligned vectors and split/consume maps same loads. Zip truncation needs malformed actual native writer before a finding. Full provenance graph/native material conservation and f32 component precision remain separate source questions.",
      "1107 includes actual food model/preparation/authority/projections/lot/custody/cooking/consumption into native module scope. cfg tests/authority-tests are source-only and never executed; no body coverage for included files from module import alone.",
      "1108 FoodLot native storage keeps fullu64 lot/row/revision, exactly one inventory link established by assessed constructors/transfers, quality1..5 at constructors. FireplaceDish pins immutable captured inputs; later catalogue changes do not rewrite cooked material. Optional instrument object None documents loose spit-roast/empty lane, not an automatic obsolete compatibility mode. Actual unsupported Someitem/Noneobject writers remain distinct question."
    ],
